### ParametriCAD AI - REST API Requests
@host = http://localhost:8000
@api = {{host}}/api/v1

### 1. Health Liveness
GET {{api}}/health/live HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### 2. Health Readiness
GET {{api}}/health/ready HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Catalog - List Parametric Models
GET {{api}}/catalog HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Catalog - Get Specific Model Schema
GET {{api}}/catalog/cube HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### 5. Generate Parametric Solid (Cube)
POST {{api}}/generate HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "model_id": "cube",
  "parameters": {
    "width": 20.0,
    "height": 20.0,
    "depth": 20.0
  }
}

### 6. OpenAPI JSON Schema
GET {{host}}/openapi.json HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
